---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
	<a
		slot="header-cta"
		class="btn btn-light btn-lg m-t-40"
		href="/subscribe-to-artists">Subscribe now</a
	>
	<div class="page-container">
		<div class="home-content">
			<h1>Subscribe to new album releases on&nbsp;Spotify</h1>

			<h2>Who is this for?</h2>

			<p>
				Anyone with an email address - no Spotify account or login needed. You
				may know that Spotify already sends weekly new release emails, however:
			</p>

			<ul>
				<li>
					We only email you about albums, which (we think) are more important to
					know about than single releases, and therefore worthy of a spot in
					your crowded inbox.
				</li>
				<li>
					Spotify's emails are biased towards featured/promoted artists, and
					miss a lot of artists.
				</li>
				<li>
					You may not care about new releases from every artist you listen to.
					This app lets you choose exactly which artists to be notified about.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>How does it work?</h2>

			<p>
				It only takes a minute – no account, no password, just your email
				address.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="how-does-it-work-container">
			<div class="how-does-it-work-step">
				<div class="image-container">
					<img
						src="/images/how-does-it-work-step-1-2.jpg"
						alt="Enter your email address"
						width="220"
						height="220"
					/>
					<div class="center-hole"></div>
				</div>

				<h4>
					1.<br />Enter your email address and we'll send you a sign-in link
				</h4>
			</div>
			<div class="how-does-it-work-step">
				<div class="image-container">
					<img
						src="/images/how-does-it-work-step-2.jpg"
						alt="Find artists via a playlist link or search"
						width="220"
						height="220"
					/>
					<div class="center-hole"></div>
				</div>

				<h4>
					2.<br />Search for artists or paste a public Spotify playlist link
				</h4>
			</div>
			<div class="how-does-it-work-step">
				<div class="image-container">
					<img
						src="/images/how-does-it-work-step-3-2.jpg"
						alt="Choose artists and subscribe"
						width="220"
						height="220"
					/>
					<div class="center-hole"></div>
				</div>

				<h4>
					3.<br />Select artists and hit subscribe
				</h4>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="home-content">
			<p>
				Our app checks for new album releases daily. If it finds one from an
				artist that you've subscribed to, we'll send you an email notification.
				It's easy to unsubscribe at any time by clicking the link in the email.
			</p>

			<h2>Ready?</h2>

			<p>
				Click the button below to get started. There's no password and no
				Spotify account – just your email address, which we verify by sending
				you a link that keeps you signed in for 24 hours. We only use your
				playlist link or search term to find artists, and we only store your
				email address and the artists you select. We will never sell or do
				anything unethical with your data. You can even see our source code on
				&nbsp;<a href="https://github.com/Ellfish/newalbums-web">Github</a>.
			</p>

			<a
				id="get-started"
				class="btn btn-primary btn-lg m-t-50"
				href="/subscribe-to-artists">Get Started</a
			>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
